@startuml
title Activity (Detailed) - Supplier Fulfillment (Ack, Delivery, GRN)

|System|
start
:Send notification to Supplier\n(in-app + Gmail, new order to acknowledge);

|Supplier|
:Open notification;
:Open Supplier Overview;
:Check new approved PO items;
:Open Order Acknowledgement module;
:Confirm or update acknowledgement details;

if (Acknowledgement submitted?) then (Yes)
  |System|
  :Save to supplier-order-acks store;
  :Notify Requester order acknowledged\n(in-app + Gmail);
  :Generate delivery as Pending Delivery;
  |Supplier|
  :Supplier prepares shipment;
  :Open Delivery module and submit delivery info;
  |System|
  :Save to deliveries store;
  :Notify Requester delivery submitted\n(in-app + Gmail);
  |Requester|
  :Requester receives goods and records GRN status;
  |System|
  :Save GRN progress to grns store;
  if (Delivery and GRN completed?) then (Yes)
    :Mark fulfillment cycle as completed;
    :Notify Requester and Supplier completed\n(in-app + Gmail);
  else (No)
    :Requester marks discrepancy in GRN;
    :Notify Supplier discrepancy found\n(in-app + Gmail, resend required);
    |Supplier|
    :Open GRN discrepancy item;
    :Click Create Delivery (resend shipment);
    |System|
    :Generate new pending delivery cycle;
    |Requester|
    :Wait for next delivery and re-check GRN;
  endif
else (No)
  |System|
  :PO remains pending acknowledgement;
endif

stop
@enduml
